# Normalize line endings in the repository, not on the developer's machine.
#
# This machine runs `core.autocrlf = true`, which checked every text file out as
# CRLF. That made byte comparisons between the working tree and a packed tarball
# report differences for identical content, and it silently changed file hashes
# used as handoff evidence. `eol=lf` keeps the working tree byte-identical to the
# repository blobs and to anything packed from them, on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must never be normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.tgz binary
